    '|a||Knight takes d5. The bishop takes your queen, and bishop to b4 is check. White''s only block is the queen; you take her, the kings take back, and you''re a piece up for a pawn: the Elephant Trap.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 15560
      voice: gemini:Charon | calm, warm chess coach
    '|a||Count what happens if White''s bishop takes your queen. Is there a check after that?':
